.TH DUMBNAVIGATOR 1 "2026-09-15" "dumbNavigator" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dumbnavigator \- internal dumb:// browser for Debian 12
.SH SYNOPSIS
dumbnavigator [dumb://URL]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A native GTK desktop shell for the dumbNavigator internal web universe. It resolves dumb:// addresses locally and does not turn them into public HTTPS navigation.
.SH FILES
The desktop build reads bundled development pages from app/src/main/assets/developeit when launched from the repository.
